  "module_docs": [
    "Port of",
    "`net.minestom.server.network.packet.client.play.ClientChatSessionUpdatePacket`.",
    "",
    "# Local stub",
    "",
    "[`ChatSessionWire`] stands in for `net.minestom.server.crypto.ChatSession`:",
    "the ported `crypto::ChatSession` carries only the session UUID, while Java's",
    "record also holds the `PlayerPublicKey` the wire form writes. Java's public",
    "key is a `java.security.PublicKey`, which the port has no equivalent for;",
    "`NetworkBuffer.PUBLIC_KEY` is `BYTE_ARRAY.transform(KeyUtils::publicRSAKeyFrom,",
    "PublicKey::getEncoded)`, so the port carries the X.509 encoding verbatim",
    "(`public_key_der`) and only the encoding is read back."
  ],
